35:03.000 --> 35:10.000
this could be an equation which has two additional terms over here or two additional coefficients

35:10.000 --> 35:17.000
one is multiplied with the variable R squared and R to the power of four

35:17.000 --> 35:23.000
this R was the radius or the distance of the pixel from the optical axis to the pixel in the image

