36:06.000 --> 36:09.000
and if you do this and want to perform the camera calibration

36:09.000 --> 36:13.000
you then typically revert to a least squares estimation approach

36:13.000 --> 36:22.000
where you estimate the distance between where the pixel of a point is actually projected to into your image

